WEBVTT

01:32.400 --> 01:35.200
Huainan is good

01:35.720 --> 01:38.760
A safe haven

01:39.280 --> 01:45.400
The mountains and rivers
Stretch on like our affection

01:46.640 --> 01:50.280
An affectionate person…

01:50.360 --> 01:51.960
Huainan is indeed a fine place,

01:52.480 --> 01:54.280
but we are no longer there.

01:54.800 --> 01:58.000
Huai'an truly thinks ten steps ahead.

01:58.080 --> 02:00.360
He even predicted
matters of life and death in his letter.

02:09.360 --> 02:11.400
You are too gentle by nature.

02:11.480 --> 02:13.720
You are the one I worry about most.

02:16.960 --> 02:18.040
If you face something

02:19.040 --> 02:20.520
you cannot overcome one day,

02:22.120 --> 02:23.640
open this letter.

02:27.240 --> 02:28.480
Zhou Mo joined the Huben Army

02:28.560 --> 02:30.120
and fell under their yoke.

02:30.640 --> 02:32.280
Only death could free him.

02:34.320 --> 02:37.040
Killing him was to save him.

02:37.120 --> 02:39.680
If I make it to the Capital alive,

02:41.080 --> 02:44.000
they will hunt you
to the ends of the Earth.

02:45.040 --> 02:46.960
Only by dying once

02:47.560 --> 02:49.520
can you truly be free.

02:49.600 --> 02:51.160
ZHOU MO JOINED THE HUBEN ARMY
AND FELL UNDER THEIR YOKE.

02:51.240 --> 02:52.920
ONLY DEATH COULD FREE HIM.
KILLING HIM WAS TO SAVE HIM.

03:02.680 --> 03:04.880
No, we are no longer in Huainan.

03:08.760 --> 03:10.840
He should be in Chang'an by now.

03:11.720 --> 03:15.080
The dangers of Chang'an
far surpass Huainan's.

03:16.680 --> 03:18.440
I hope he stays safe.

03:19.800 --> 03:21.720
He will.

03:49.440 --> 03:51.000
YANG XUAN, VICE MINISTER OF REVENUE

03:52.160 --> 03:53.080
AT DAWN I RISE

03:53.160 --> 03:54.560
PARTING WEIGHS ON MY MIND

04:11.440 --> 04:14.680
BAI WAN, YANG XUAN'S STUDENT

04:14.760 --> 04:21.640
Studying by the cold window
I never sensed how brief the seasons were

04:23.280 --> 04:28.480
In a blink, my temples
Have turned to gray frost

04:28.560 --> 04:29.480
REBEL FIRE

04:33.640 --> 04:38.920
Schemes for the realm are but a dream

04:40.720 --> 04:46.960
I wake from wine
To Hu-horses trampling the land

04:50.400 --> 04:56.040
The loyal dead would never
Stain their bones with rebel fire

04:58.440 --> 05:04.760
Yet traitors crave
The splendor of the August hall

05:08.680 --> 05:13.480
Half a life I spent on these texts
For whom were they written?

05:14.960 --> 05:18.120
For whom, I ask?

05:20.240 --> 05:27.000
Let this long lament burn
As an offering unto the mountain spirits

05:29.240 --> 05:36.120
Let this long lament burn
As an offering unto the mountain spirits

06:02.280 --> 06:03.880
‎SCHOLARS' HALL

06:03.960 --> 06:05.200
Sir!

06:22.600 --> 06:23.480
Sir…

06:26.120 --> 06:27.240
Sir?

06:35.840 --> 06:37.080
Sir…

06:51.160 --> 06:53.120
Why are you guarding this traitor?

06:54.080 --> 06:55.600
I was his student.

06:56.800 --> 06:58.880
Now that he lies dead on the street,

07:00.800 --> 07:02.560
please let me keep vigil

07:03.240 --> 07:05.600
until the Jingzhao Yamen
comes to claim his body.

07:13.120 --> 07:14.640
He was a traitor.

07:15.160 --> 07:17.240
We of the Imperial Guards will take him.

07:18.080 --> 07:20.080
You call yourself his student.

07:22.320 --> 07:24.120
Are you a traitor too?

07:34.520 --> 07:36.800
Sir, this has nothing to do with us.

07:37.680 --> 07:38.560
Please proceed.

07:40.200 --> 07:44.000
It has nothing to do with you indeed.

07:45.080 --> 07:46.880
-Take her!
-Stop.

08:20.560 --> 08:22.000
In this bitter snow,

08:23.280 --> 08:25.400
she is willing to keep vigil
over this old man's body.

08:26.280 --> 08:27.560
It is a righteous deed,

08:28.840 --> 08:30.360
yet you call her a traitor?

08:32.480 --> 08:33.520
Have you any proof?

08:43.840 --> 08:46.120
I cannot stand scholars.

08:46.640 --> 08:50.280
Are you seeking
to light your own path to the grave?

08:56.240 --> 08:57.600
You all heard him.

08:58.360 --> 09:00.240
He tried to defend this traitor.

09:00.880 --> 09:01.720
Take him too!

09:02.560 --> 09:03.680
Hold!

09:04.640 --> 09:06.840
Who dares bar the Imperial Guards?

09:11.920 --> 09:14.920
Academician Li, what brings you here?

09:15.680 --> 09:17.360
You Imperial Guards are bold indeed,

09:17.440 --> 09:18.880
blocking anyone as you please.

09:21.120 --> 09:22.400
Greetings to you, Mr. Huai'an.

09:23.160 --> 09:24.000
Greetings, Academician Li.

09:24.080 --> 09:25.960
His Majesty awaits you in the palace.

09:26.040 --> 09:27.440
Please get in.

09:31.400 --> 09:33.640
"Studying by the cold window, I never
sensed how brief the seasons were."

09:33.720 --> 09:35.600
"In a blink, my temples
have turned to gray frost."

09:36.200 --> 09:38.120
"Schemes for the realm are but a dream."

09:38.760 --> 09:41.200
"I wake from wine
to Hu-horses trampling the land."

09:42.000 --> 09:44.320
"The loyal dead would never
stain their bones with rebel fire,

09:45.520 --> 09:48.120
yet traitors crave
the splendor of the August hall."

09:49.440 --> 09:51.800
"Half a life I spent on these texts.
For whom were they written?"

09:51.880 --> 09:54.240
"Let this long lament burn
as an offering unto the mountain spirits."

09:59.880 --> 10:01.760
You called me a traitor

10:02.360 --> 10:03.880
without a shred of proof.

10:04.480 --> 10:06.600
I recited a seditious poem just now.

10:07.240 --> 10:08.920
That, at least, is some proof.

10:09.520 --> 10:12.960
Can you confirm that I am a traitor now?

10:16.480 --> 10:17.880
You are silent.

10:18.680 --> 10:20.040
Does that mean I am not one?

10:21.440 --> 10:24.720
If we've come to a point where words alone

10:25.400 --> 10:27.520
can convict someone of treason,

10:28.120 --> 10:29.760
then heed my words:

10:31.640 --> 10:33.640
you are a traitor.

10:34.560 --> 10:36.280
You are a traitor.

10:36.360 --> 10:37.640
A traitor!

10:42.120 --> 10:43.080
Mr. Huai'an,

10:43.880 --> 10:45.600
don't take his words to heart.

10:52.560 --> 10:55.600
-Academician Li, I have one small request.
-Of course.

10:55.680 --> 10:57.120
Please leave them be.

10:58.720 --> 10:59.800
Very well.

11:01.680 --> 11:02.880
Be gone!

11:04.280 --> 11:05.280
I shall take my leave.

11:07.320 --> 11:08.360
Let us go!

11:09.040 --> 11:10.880
This way, please.

11:13.240 --> 11:15.960
ORCHID PAVILION

11:43.160 --> 11:44.440
Take this to shelter him

11:45.920 --> 11:47.360
from the wind and snow.

11:53.720 --> 11:54.560
Thank you.

12:22.600 --> 12:27.280
Wan, there is something I must tell you.

12:30.360 --> 12:32.480
That article slandering the new emperor

12:32.560 --> 12:34.200
was written by me.

12:35.000 --> 12:37.360
I work for the Huben Army.

12:37.880 --> 12:40.400
My rise to this post

12:40.480 --> 12:43.960
was propped up by them.

12:44.560 --> 12:46.080
Everything I did

12:46.600 --> 12:49.840
was at their command.

12:50.560 --> 12:54.080
Now, I must let this frail body of mine
fulfill its final purpose

12:54.160 --> 12:57.800
so that they will keep my family safe.

12:58.960 --> 13:00.160
The Huben Army

13:00.800 --> 13:02.520
once asked me about you.

13:03.760 --> 13:05.160
After I die,

13:06.200 --> 13:07.880
they will come for you.

13:08.560 --> 13:12.520
I can only give you one last warning:

13:12.600 --> 13:16.320
never defy the Huben Army.

13:16.960 --> 13:20.120
You still hope to see
your family again, don't you?

13:20.720 --> 13:22.560
Then do whatever it takes

13:23.160 --> 13:24.320
to survive.

13:29.800 --> 13:30.960
Sir…

13:35.200 --> 13:37.040
Do not grieve for me.

13:37.560 --> 13:38.920
Everyone

13:39.920 --> 13:43.800
must walk the road fate has set for them.

13:44.840 --> 13:46.360
Rest now,

13:47.840 --> 13:48.840
Wan.

13:50.600 --> 13:56.720
This may be your last peaceful sleep.

13:59.440 --> 14:00.320
Tonight,

14:01.120 --> 14:03.920
I will take my life at the city gate

14:04.440 --> 14:07.920
as an old minister of the former court

14:08.000 --> 14:10.960
to show my defiance of the new emperor.

14:12.680 --> 14:15.760
Yan Fengshan commands the Huben Army

14:15.840 --> 14:17.280
and held the court in his grasp for years.

14:18.200 --> 14:20.880
Xiao Wuyang seized Chang'an

14:20.960 --> 14:23.400
to keep imperial power from slipping away.

14:24.680 --> 14:28.800
Though the Huben Army
has avoided meeting him head-on,

14:29.320 --> 14:33.440
Yan Fengshan still intends
to set Chang'an aflame

14:34.080 --> 14:36.560
and grant Xiao Wuyang no peace.

14:39.200 --> 14:44.600
And I am a piece of wood
they need for that fire.

14:50.880 --> 14:54.200
‎HOUSE OF WESTERN CURIOSITIES

15:29.160 --> 15:30.320
Academician Li.

15:30.840 --> 15:32.040
I hope you do not mind

15:32.800 --> 15:34.400
that I used your hand to slap

15:34.480 --> 15:35.720
the Imperial Guards in the face.

15:37.240 --> 15:38.800
Not at all.

15:38.880 --> 15:41.000
They deserved it.

15:41.600 --> 15:43.560
I meant to humble that commander.

15:43.640 --> 15:45.320
Even if you hadn't been there, sir,

15:45.960 --> 15:48.880
I would have simply found another way

15:48.960 --> 15:50.640
to shame him another day.

15:51.280 --> 15:54.160
That is how I handle matters.

16:11.960 --> 16:12.840
Assassins!

16:12.920 --> 16:13.920
Protect His Majesty!

16:14.000 --> 16:15.320
Quick, protect His Majesty!

16:15.400 --> 16:16.480
-Understood!
-Understood!

16:16.560 --> 16:17.680
Assassins!

16:18.280 --> 16:20.800
Assassins! Protect His Majesty!

16:23.880 --> 16:25.520
The realm is still unsettled.

16:25.600 --> 16:27.760
It's been but a month
since His Majesty took the throne,

16:27.840 --> 16:30.960
and already a dozen assassination attempts
have been made.

16:31.600 --> 16:33.200
No need to panic, though.

16:35.480 --> 16:37.120
Under the Dingtang Sword,

16:38.320 --> 16:40.160
all who come lose their heads.

17:49.200 --> 17:51.600
Your servant, Xie Huai'an,

17:51.680 --> 17:53.000
greets Your Majesty.

17:56.080 --> 17:57.120
Lift your head.

17:59.120 --> 18:00.400
I asked many people

18:00.480 --> 18:03.240
who could seek someone for me
in this vast world.

18:03.320 --> 18:06.200
They all recommended you,

18:07.120 --> 18:09.040
so I wished to see for myself

18:10.280 --> 18:11.640
whether you were equal to the task.

18:15.680 --> 18:18.600
These ten essays were all written
for the imperial examination

18:18.680 --> 18:20.040
in the 11th year of the dynasty.

18:20.680 --> 18:22.120
One of them was written by me.

18:22.200 --> 18:23.680
Find it.

18:24.280 --> 18:26.000
As you command.

18:26.080 --> 18:29.680
WISDOM AND DEPTH

18:36.840 --> 18:38.200
ZHU XIAOCHUN, VICE MINISTER OF RITES
AND KEEPER OF IMPERIAL SEALS

19:02.240 --> 19:03.240
BENEVOLENT RULE

19:06.000 --> 19:07.760
HE UNITED THE LORDS AND STEADIED
THE REALM, RISING AS THE FOREMOST HEGEMON

19:07.840 --> 19:09.440
THE FORCEFUL RULE
AND THE BENEVOLENT RULE

19:23.280 --> 19:26.360
Your Majesty, I have found your essay.

19:27.360 --> 19:29.680
It's only been half a stick of incense.

19:30.640 --> 19:32.560
Even if you read ten lines at a glance,

19:32.640 --> 19:34.800
you could only have finished
three or four essays.

19:37.920 --> 19:39.680
How did you manage it?

19:40.800 --> 19:42.280
Southerners and northerners differ.

19:42.360 --> 19:44.520
Their wording and phrasing leave traces.

19:44.600 --> 19:47.120
Before Your Majesty turned 20,
you lived long in Chang'an.

19:47.200 --> 19:48.240
Your early studies

19:48.320 --> 19:50.520
were under Grand Secretary Bai Linian,

19:51.080 --> 19:52.600
who was from Wuyue.

19:53.120 --> 19:57.920
Therefore, Your Majesty's writing
shows southern traits.

19:58.960 --> 20:00.200
Southerners write "lu" as "six,"

20:00.280 --> 20:02.800
"qi" as "stand," and "bei" as "cover."

20:02.880 --> 20:04.440
Northerners write "chen" as "ugly,"

20:04.520 --> 20:06.640
"geng" as "road," and "tong" as "reach."

20:07.520 --> 20:08.600
By this measure,

20:08.680 --> 20:11.960
seven of the essays
were written by northerners,

20:12.040 --> 20:14.280
and only three by southerners.

20:14.880 --> 20:18.520
Everyone has words and phrases
they tend to repeat.

20:18.600 --> 20:20.280
"In troubled times,

20:20.360 --> 20:21.880
hearts are easily disturbed,

20:21.960 --> 20:24.240
so virtue alone cannot calm them."

20:25.000 --> 20:28.920
I once saw this line in a court memorial.

20:29.880 --> 20:31.560
That's how I knew.

20:32.160 --> 20:33.320
How could a mere registrar

20:33.400 --> 20:35.360
have access to memorials?

20:36.120 --> 20:38.360
The Memorials Office
keeps expired memorials.

20:38.440 --> 20:41.400
They say they are burned
after three months,

20:42.080 --> 20:43.160
but royal writings

20:43.920 --> 20:46.000
are cherished among the people,

20:46.680 --> 20:48.600
so some were secretly sold.

20:49.280 --> 20:52.080
I also bought some myself.

20:59.720 --> 21:01.200
This level of wit

21:03.480 --> 21:06.680
is not enough for this mission.

21:13.720 --> 21:15.320
You would do well

21:16.520 --> 21:18.640
to give me more surprises.

21:22.560 --> 21:24.200
More surprises, Your Majesty?

21:26.280 --> 21:29.800
I know I wasn't the only one
commanded to enter the Capital.

21:32.200 --> 21:34.200
Nor was I the first to find

21:34.840 --> 21:36.080
Your Majesty's essay.

21:37.040 --> 21:38.000
The first to do so

21:38.680 --> 21:39.760
is dead now.

21:41.640 --> 21:42.960
In the assassination just now,

21:43.640 --> 21:45.800
the assassins numbered two,

21:46.400 --> 21:47.640
yet Your Majesty

21:48.600 --> 21:49.960
killed three men.

21:56.320 --> 21:59.600
Your Majesty, whom do you seek?

22:05.920 --> 22:07.120
Yan Fengshan of the Huben Army

22:07.920 --> 22:09.840
and Xiao Wenjing, the deposed emperor.

22:10.880 --> 22:12.600
I want both their bodies

22:13.680 --> 22:15.240
brought before me.

22:17.640 --> 22:19.560
I will find the deposed emperor,

22:20.760 --> 22:22.000
but Yan Fengshan

22:23.040 --> 22:23.880
is mine.

22:25.120 --> 22:27.240
How dare you haggle with me?

22:28.640 --> 22:30.040
I have wanted to kill him

22:31.400 --> 22:33.720
for 15 years.

22:41.760 --> 22:43.320
Stand at attention!

22:44.000 --> 22:45.040
If anyone sees you like this,

22:45.120 --> 22:46.280
what will they think?

22:50.240 --> 22:52.160
Your Majesty, do you care for this realm?

22:54.040 --> 22:57.440
If I did not, why seize it?

22:58.800 --> 23:00.840
And do you care for the throne?

23:05.880 --> 23:07.240
Even if I don't,

23:08.440 --> 23:11.920
it is not for Yan Fengshan to touch.

23:13.200 --> 23:14.960
The deposed emperor is weak-willed.

23:16.280 --> 23:18.520
Yan Fengshan controlled the court
for years.

23:20.120 --> 23:23.400
He was long known
as Emperor Yan among the people.

23:24.520 --> 23:26.200
Now that Your Majesty
has reclaimed Chang'an,

23:26.800 --> 23:29.080
he will not yield easily.

23:31.000 --> 23:32.560
He abducted your brother.

23:34.640 --> 23:35.800
He will strike back.

23:42.680 --> 23:44.440
Kill Yan Fengshan,

23:45.840 --> 23:46.880
and his head is yours.

23:48.080 --> 23:49.520
If you fail,

23:52.440 --> 23:54.440
your head is mine.

23:59.000 --> 24:00.240
My thanks, Your Majesty.

24:06.080 --> 24:07.800
In my memory, whenever Your Majesty

24:08.480 --> 24:10.000
has something on your mind,

24:11.120 --> 24:12.840
you always take out that flute.

24:14.920 --> 24:16.480
You have just ascended the throne,

24:17.360 --> 24:18.720
yet you look burdened.

24:24.040 --> 24:25.680
It seems this throne

24:26.320 --> 24:28.000
matters little to Your Majesty after all.

24:48.080 --> 24:48.960
Sir.

24:49.040 --> 24:51.080
Sir, please get in the carriage.

24:51.160 --> 24:52.560
It is bitterly cold tonight.

24:52.640 --> 24:54.240
Allow us to escort you
from the Palace City.

24:55.960 --> 24:57.360
No need for a carriage.

24:58.200 --> 25:00.920
But I'd like to trouble you
to walk with me.

25:01.000 --> 25:02.480
I prefer to go on foot.

25:09.120 --> 25:10.080
Academician Li,

25:10.160 --> 25:12.960
don't you wish to know
why His Majesty summoned me?

25:13.960 --> 25:15.880
That is not for me to ask.

25:15.960 --> 25:19.880
Whatever His Majesty commands, we obey.

25:20.760 --> 25:22.360
We must not inquire.

25:29.800 --> 25:32.160
The deposed emperor was taken
by Yan Fengshan.

25:43.600 --> 25:44.440
His Majesty wishes to…

25:45.640 --> 25:46.920
Have mercy!

25:47.000 --> 25:48.320
You said nothing.

25:48.400 --> 25:50.000
I heard nothing.

25:50.720 --> 25:51.840
Have mercy, I beg you.

25:54.320 --> 25:56.200
I just checked the palace registry.

25:56.280 --> 25:58.120
Among all Imperial Academy scholars

25:58.720 --> 26:01.120
permitted to enter the Inner Court,

26:02.760 --> 26:04.760
there is no academician named Li.

26:09.920 --> 26:10.960
Chancellor Gao,

26:13.720 --> 26:14.840
we have exchanged messages

26:16.640 --> 26:18.240
for some time now.

26:19.240 --> 26:20.800
We finally met today.

26:21.680 --> 26:23.440
How long do you intend
to maintain this act?

26:30.280 --> 26:32.560
Your wit borders on the uncanny.

26:33.360 --> 26:34.880
Take care, or you will not live long.

26:36.280 --> 26:39.080
Xie Huai'an greets Chancellor Gao.

26:39.160 --> 26:42.120
GAO YAN

26:42.200 --> 26:45.760
Where… where did I give myself away?

26:46.960 --> 26:49.640
Chancellor Gao, you did not.

26:50.400 --> 26:55.040
It is simply that
I am too cautious by nature.

26:55.920 --> 26:59.560
I do not overlook
a single word or sentence.

26:59.640 --> 27:01.000
No need to panic, though.

27:01.080 --> 27:03.480
Under the Dingtang Sword,

27:04.360 --> 27:06.160
all who come lose their heads.

27:07.000 --> 27:08.440
"Under the Dingtang Sword,

27:08.520 --> 27:09.760
all who come lose their heads."

27:10.680 --> 27:14.160
Were you a mere academician
of the Imperial Academy,

27:14.840 --> 27:16.960
how could you have shown such pride

27:17.760 --> 27:18.760
when faced with assassins?

27:26.640 --> 27:29.560
The Marquis of Northguard, Gu Yu,
recommended the famed Han Ziling,

27:30.080 --> 27:31.240
while I recommended you.

27:31.840 --> 27:33.960
It seems my judgment was sound.

27:36.120 --> 27:39.040
Han Ziling only writes fine prose.

27:39.800 --> 27:44.000
He is not likely to survive
the Dingtang Sword.

27:44.080 --> 27:46.240
You have accepted His Majesty's mission.

27:46.320 --> 27:48.080
How am I to assist you?

27:48.720 --> 27:49.840
Chancellor Gao,

27:50.560 --> 27:52.120
haven't you already done so?

27:53.320 --> 27:54.160
How so?

27:54.760 --> 27:56.920
Since there is no Academician Li,

27:57.000 --> 27:58.160
why did that commander

27:58.680 --> 28:00.560
address you as such?

28:02.560 --> 28:03.400
Academician Li.

28:04.200 --> 28:05.840
He is your man, isn't he?

28:06.560 --> 28:08.360
If ever I require aid,

28:09.040 --> 28:10.240
I will seek him out.

28:15.720 --> 28:18.720
To find such an uncut piece of jade

28:18.800 --> 28:20.080
in this freezing night

28:20.600 --> 28:23.400
is worth the cold.

28:35.960 --> 28:39.800
Han Ziling is already
one of the brightest minds in the realm,

28:40.520 --> 28:43.160
yet His Majesty chose this Xie Huai'an.

28:45.600 --> 28:48.720
His days are numbered.

28:52.320 --> 28:54.280
We shall see.

28:56.960 --> 28:58.040
After all,

28:59.040 --> 29:01.360
he was chosen by Chancellor Gao,

29:02.400 --> 29:06.720
and Chancellor Gao
has never misjudged a man.

29:10.280 --> 29:12.120
BUDDHA TEMPLE

29:12.200 --> 29:15.640
Wan, when you wake,

29:15.720 --> 29:19.680
go to the ruined temple east of the city.

29:19.760 --> 29:23.040
Light the candle before the Buddha statue,

29:24.440 --> 29:28.200
and a Huben guard will appear.

29:42.040 --> 29:43.440
This temple

29:44.720 --> 29:47.480
was ruined by war
and fell into this state.

29:50.480 --> 29:53.480
QINGYI OF THE HUBEN ARMY

29:54.480 --> 29:56.000
It used to be crowded with worshippers.

29:57.280 --> 29:58.680
Those who came here

29:58.760 --> 30:00.720
all said it was blessed.

30:01.320 --> 30:02.760
You may as well make a wish.

30:04.200 --> 30:05.440
Yang Xuan is dead.

30:05.520 --> 30:07.120
You were his student.

30:10.040 --> 30:13.680
Pray to the Bodhisattva and the underworld

30:14.360 --> 30:17.600
that he may suffer less pain over there.

30:35.400 --> 30:37.040
You have a fiery temper.

30:37.680 --> 30:39.840
But it is useless,

30:41.040 --> 30:43.360
at least before a Huben guard.

30:47.440 --> 30:49.040
You have never taken a life, have you?

30:50.160 --> 30:51.240
If not,

30:51.320 --> 30:54.440
there is no need to draw the dagger
in your sleeve.

30:55.240 --> 30:56.400
It cannot harm me.

30:57.480 --> 30:59.080
You knew the Huben Army
would come for you,

30:59.160 --> 31:01.160
yet you still came as you were told.

31:01.680 --> 31:05.200
Had you used this chance to flee,
wouldn't that have been better?

31:06.440 --> 31:09.440
Chang'an is full of Huben shadow guards.

31:10.040 --> 31:12.600
I'd be caught before reaching
the city gate.

31:12.680 --> 31:14.720
Rather than make a fool of myself,

31:15.360 --> 31:16.200
I'd sooner

31:18.120 --> 31:19.400
vent my anger before I die.

31:20.120 --> 31:22.120
I never intended to kill you.

31:24.400 --> 31:26.720
Yang Xuan was the Vice Minister
of Revenue, a third-rank official.

31:26.800 --> 31:28.800
His death means something
to the Huben Army.

31:28.880 --> 31:31.280
As for you, you are but a lowly painter.

31:31.360 --> 31:33.160
Even if you die in a roadside ditch,

31:33.240 --> 31:36.760
who will truly care?

31:40.800 --> 31:44.200
Anyway, I invited you here for a purpose.

31:45.360 --> 31:46.960
You have no value,

31:48.160 --> 31:49.720
but the one

31:50.720 --> 31:51.920
who corresponded with you does.

31:52.960 --> 31:54.560
I want you to tell me

31:55.320 --> 31:58.240
how you first met him.

32:01.200 --> 32:02.840
We met by chance.

32:03.840 --> 32:04.800
I cannot help you.

32:11.560 --> 32:12.400
No matter.

32:18.440 --> 32:20.400
Met by chance, did you?

32:21.960 --> 32:23.520
I still have patience enough.

32:25.280 --> 32:28.000
I know you work at the Painting Academy.

32:28.600 --> 32:30.280
And I also know

32:30.360 --> 32:33.480
there is a Mr. Yu there
who treats you well.

32:35.600 --> 32:39.320
I give you two hours.

32:40.800 --> 32:43.960
If you still say the same after two hours,

32:47.240 --> 32:49.000
the hands of the Huben Army

32:50.280 --> 32:52.560
will reach for Mr. Yu.

33:03.000 --> 33:04.680
This silver needle…

33:07.440 --> 33:09.800
What a clumsy trick.

33:11.360 --> 33:12.920
You have a long way to go.

33:45.000 --> 33:47.200
Someone, open the door!

33:50.440 --> 33:51.640
-Miss Bai Wan?
-Is Mr. Yu here?

33:51.720 --> 33:52.640
Master was about to rest.

33:52.720 --> 33:54.520
-Miss Bai Wan, why--
-I must speak with him.

33:54.600 --> 33:55.840
A life is at stake. Forgive my intrusion.

33:56.440 --> 33:57.520
Miss Bai Wan!

34:02.120 --> 34:04.240
Mr. Yu, forgive me
for disturbing you so late,

34:04.320 --> 34:05.320
but I must speak with you.

34:05.400 --> 34:07.200
MR. YU, CHIEF PAINTER
OF THE PAINTING ACADEMY

34:07.280 --> 34:08.560
Why did you come?

34:12.960 --> 34:17.760
Why did you come?

34:25.000 --> 34:26.760
If I hadn't,

34:31.480 --> 34:32.920
would you have…?

34:39.360 --> 34:40.760
The Huben guards said

34:42.000 --> 34:43.920
that if you came tonight,

34:44.719 --> 34:45.639
I would have to die.

34:48.600 --> 34:50.280
Why did you come?

34:50.840 --> 34:52.520
When the Huben Army gives an order,

34:52.600 --> 34:53.719
you follow it.

34:53.800 --> 34:55.560
Why resist?

35:02.920 --> 35:04.440
-Sir!
-Come no closer!

35:09.360 --> 35:10.280
I accept my fate.

35:44.200 --> 35:47.240
Mr. Qingyi
asked me to bring you a message.

35:48.560 --> 35:51.000
He said that before the Huben Army,

35:51.080 --> 35:52.280
one could only obey.

35:52.880 --> 35:53.920
Mr. Yu's death

35:54.840 --> 35:56.840
is the price of your defiance.

36:06.840 --> 36:07.920
Greetings, Mr. Qingyi.

36:08.520 --> 36:09.880
The world is in chaos.

36:10.800 --> 36:12.840
Human lives are worth little more
than weeds.

36:13.520 --> 36:16.880
What value does that girl have
that Mr. Yu must die for her?

36:17.640 --> 36:19.360
She knows the one

36:19.880 --> 36:23.440
the entire Huben Army has been hunting
for more than a decade.

36:25.240 --> 36:26.880
She wrote to him.

36:27.880 --> 36:29.960
I once intercepted a messenger.

36:30.040 --> 36:32.280
He killed himself,

36:32.360 --> 36:34.080
and the trail went cold.

36:37.000 --> 36:38.680
Only by slaying Mr. Yu

36:40.320 --> 36:41.840
could we frighten her.

36:45.000 --> 36:46.640
Give her two days.

36:47.840 --> 36:49.920
She will write to beg him for help,

36:51.360 --> 36:53.960
and I will have a trail to follow.

37:06.960 --> 37:09.800
Yan Fengshan refused to serve
under your father,

37:10.320 --> 37:12.080
so he led the entire Huben Army
in rebellion.

37:13.920 --> 37:15.160
The late emperor was too old

37:15.240 --> 37:17.520
to hold him accountable.

37:17.600 --> 37:19.600
He could only let
Yan Fengshan's power grow.

37:22.000 --> 37:24.280
Find the men I seek,

37:24.920 --> 37:29.480
and I will avenge the Liu family.

37:49.760 --> 37:51.560
-Run!
-Father!

38:14.520 --> 38:16.200
Run!

39:31.280 --> 39:32.640
I have returned.

40:44.640 --> 40:48.440
YE ZHENG

40:52.640 --> 40:55.320
What you instructed is done.

41:00.360 --> 41:01.200
How badly are you hurt?

41:01.920 --> 41:03.480
To fulfill the mission you assigned,

41:03.560 --> 41:04.640
this is nothing.

41:04.720 --> 41:06.760
Even losing half my life would have been

41:07.320 --> 41:08.160
worth the cost.

41:11.320 --> 41:12.560
Take this.

41:14.200 --> 41:15.280
Where is he?

41:15.800 --> 41:16.920
This way.

41:35.280 --> 41:38.040
XIAO WENJING, THE DEPOSED EMPEROR

41:45.440 --> 41:48.280
Greetings, Your Majesty.
